  "preciseScope": "Only sort_4(array,full length,non-null comparator) needed by PortListSorter. Keep copy/insertion threshold7/recursive buffer exchange/comparison<=0 shortcut/merge tie-left sequence. Python list/type/bounds replacements reuse approved host mappings. No natural-order comparator, whole Arrays class or runtime copied.",
  "whyRequired": "FIXED_ORDER with missing index fallback can be non-transitive: A(index0,pos10)>B(index absent,pos5)>C(index2,pos0), but A<C by index. Python Timsort stability is not an equivalence proof; actual comparison schedule and buffer operations must follow the fixed generated sort.",
